A||||1||84Bill||In my own way||||1||
Z||000000||84Bill||09-18-2001||10:18 AM||||I think I still have not totaly come to grips with all that has happened. I think the message and image I put together below best describes my feelings. I don't know why but I feel the need to share this with you all.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://a1032.g.akamai.net/f/1032/81/30m/www.gamesville.lycos.com/art_gv/ribbon_small.gif"> <P>  May God show mercy on the families of those lost. May they all feel the warm blanket of American love and compassion comfort them in this most trying hour. Our eyes wet with sadness and clasped hands trembling, we pray for the many souls lost from us.  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/flag.jpg">  <P>Picture from <A HREF="http://http://www.time.com/time/photoessays/shattered/" TARGET=_blank>Shattered</A> <BR>a collection of photographs by photojournalist James Nachtwey <BR><p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 09-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Rick 88||09-18-2001||05:05 PM||||<BR>Amen<P>Rick 88||||reg||9
